.DS_Store

# dist/ is deliberately NOT ignored. Fujin's build outputs are its deliverable,
# and consumers install from a git tag — if dist/ were absent from the tag, every
# consumer would need this repo's devDependencies and a working network to build
# it themselves at install time. Committed outputs also make token drift visible
# in review: a changed hex value shows up in the diff instead of appearing
# silently on the next build. Regenerate with `npm run build` before committing.
